<title>JAPAN: Sumitomo Bank - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Sumitomo Bank - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Revenues	     1.03 trln	 vs	    1.29 trln</p>
<p> Operating	  137.90		vs	  202.64</p>
<p> Current	     88.04		vs	   70.44</p>
<p> Net		   51.29		vs	   69.44</p>
